WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.139 --> 00:00:09.020
I believe this is the last video you are going
to see in which I am at this cottage.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:15.430
I believe that is all I have to say, I think
this is the last video.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:19.829
I am not sure when I’m going to see you
again as I will be in a time of transition.

00:00:19.829 --> 00:00:29.840
I will be taking a week off at least to try
to relocate my life but I’m sure how the

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.879
next couple months will look like.

00:00:32.879 --> 00:00:35.660
I will do my best to give updates.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.780
But yes, it’s going to be a journey.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:02:07.869
I am sending so much love, and I will see
you very soon.

00:02:07.869 --> 00:03:33.540
Goodbye.

